## Deployment Guide

### Prerequisites

1. FastAPI backend running with Phase 2 code
2. SQLite installed (included with Python)
3. Starknet relayer service available (for real transactions)

### Startup

```bash
# Start backend with Phase 2 workers integrated
pm2 start backend/app/main.py --name zkdefi-backend

# Verify workers started
pm2 logs zkdefi-backend | grep -E "worker started"
```

### Monitoring

```bash
# View active executions
sqlite3 backend/data/executions.db \
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM executions WHERE status = 'pending'"

# Check database size
ls -lh backend/data/executions.db

# View worker logs
pm2 logs zkdefi-backend | grep EventArchival
pm2 logs zkdefi-backend | grep TxConfirmation
```

### Health Check

```bash
# Test relayer client
curl http://localhost:8003/api/v1/zkdefi/oracle/execution/stats/0x...

# Expected response:
# {
#   "total": 0,
#   "confirmed": 0,
#   "pending": 0,
#   "failed": 0
# }
```

